{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Machinery.HeckeTauAssignmentH3","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeTauAssignmentH3","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Machinery.HeckeMonodromyWeightFiltration","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.LinearCombination"],"declarations":4,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.tauAssignmentH3_ker_le_range_monodromyN","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.tauAssignmentH3_ker_le_range_monodromyN","kind":"theorem","line":99,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeTauAssignmentH3.lean#L99-L124","doc":"**Kernel exactness**: a state killed by the assignment lies in the\nimage of the nilpotent. With the structure field `kills_nilpotent`\n(the reverse inclusion), the assignment descends to an isomorphism\n`coker N ≅ ℂ³` — the exact CW-multiplicity match, the promised\nsemisimple-quotient provenance. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.tauAssignmentH3_surjective","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.tauAssignmentH3_surjective","kind":"theorem","line":90,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeTauAssignmentH3.lean#L90-L97","doc":"**Surjectivity onto the isotypic model**: every vector supported on\nthe 3-dimensional CW slot is hit — the inhabitation is not the trivial\none. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.tauAssignmentH3_toFun_apply_three","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.tauAssignmentH3_toFun_apply_three","kind":"theorem","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeTauAssignmentH3.lean#L84-L88","doc":"The fourth coordinate of the assignment is identically zero: the\nlocal-monodromy datum populates only the 3-dimensional isotypic slot,\nmatching the Chevalley–Weil (3,1) split of the cover's `H^{1,0}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.tauAssignmentH3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.tauAssignmentH3","kind":"def","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeTauAssignmentH3.lean#L60-L82","doc":"**The H3-rung τ-assignment**: the three coker(N)-dual functionals\n`v ↦ v(2p) + i·v(2p+1)` on the descent pairs of the H3 cell, into the\n3-dimensional deck-multiplier-`i` isotypic slot of the genus-4\n`H^{1,0}` model, with the conjugate partner into `H^{0,1}`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}